      {
        "text": "3,000 GPU glass instances. One field draw.\nStream → wave → vortex.\n\nLiquid Glass Kit 0.10: separate 8-lens GPU test 1.58 → 0.85ms (47% less; Chrome 152/M1 Pro, 5 paired runs).\n\nCSS stays the default. Play with it:\nhttps://wpsydev.github.io/liquid-glass-kit/flow/",
        "url": "https://x.com/wpsygames/status/2109037423493828848",
        "parent": null
      },
      {
        "text": "How: cached wallpaper, bounded lens draws, shader-driven motion.\nMap generation: 16.8 → 4.1ms (31 paired batches; byte-identical output).\nFrame callbacks stayed ~60Hz. No FPS claim. Cached optics are approximate.\nMethod + raw data:\nhttps://github.com/wpsydev/liquid-glass-kit/blob/main/docs/RENDERING.md",
        "url": "https://x.com/wpsygames/status/2109037626179383461",
        "parent": "https://x.com/wpsygames/status/2109037423493828848"
      },
      {
